 "message": "A 6-frame red taunt: a red exclamation mark pops in with a bounce, a red shockwave ring punches outward twice, and two short red anger marks flick off the top corners before the ring breaks up and fades. It's a 4-colour red ramp with a dark outline on a transparent background, no character. The anger marks are small and partly hidden behind the ring, so they're the first thing to adjust if you want them bolder; the ring's speed and the exclamation's size are also easy to tweak.",
